  "notes": "{梱包|こんぽう} means commercial or industrial packing, typically for shipping ({梱|こん} bale/pack + {包|ぽう} wrap).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {梱包|こんぽう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to pack\n- {梱包|こんぽう}⟦{材|ざい}→〜材：28347_zai⟧: packing material\n- ⟦{丁寧|ていねい}→丁寧：00896_teinei⟧な{梱包|こんぽう}: careful packaging\n- ⟦{過剰|かじょう}→過剰：04123_kajou⟧{梱包|こんぽう}: excessive packaging (an environmental concern in e-commerce)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {梱包|こんぽう}: professional/commercial, shipping-focused\n- ⟦{荷造|にづく}り→荷造り：07938_nizukuri⟧: general packing, including personal moving\n- ⟦{包装|ほうそう}→包装：11932_housou⟧: wrapping/packaging, more retail-focused\n\nREGISTER: Neutral; common in business and e-commerce contexts.",
